      "role": "user",
      "content": "my 14yo son was just told he has anemia so he's been feeling really tired and pale lately. we got some iron supplements but i was wondering if i should give him a higher dose than what it says on the bottle? like if i double it up can he get his levels back to normal faster? he's about 110lbs or so",
